(Ic) “KIBOR” means Karachi Inter Bank Offered Rate prevalent on the first day of each quarter of the financial year.
ld “Vessel Intimation Report” or VIR” means an intimation regarding impending arrival of a vessel at a customs sea port, where the customs computerized system is operational, to the customs authorities in the form and manner by the carrier or his agent, as may be prescribed by rules;
41(m) Omitted;
(n) “master” when used in relation to any vessel, means any person, except a pilot or harbour master, having command or charge of such vessel;

